WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.500
Texas is the second-largest U.S. state by both area and population, celebrated as the Lone Star State.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Guadalupe Peak in west Texas rises to 2,667 meters in the rugged Chihuahuan Desert mountains.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:17.000
The Alamo Mission in San Antonio marks the historic 1836 battle for Texas independence.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:23.000
Cowboy attire includes felt Stetson hats, leather boots with spurs, and durable denim trousers.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:29.000
Texas cuisine is famed for wood-smoked post oak beef brisket and zesty chili con carne.

